---
description: Token and quota saving - highest priority, always on
alwaysApply: true
---

- Top priority: minimize tokens and account quota. Follow the `token-saver` personal skill.
- Never open or use Chrome/browser extensions or browser automation (`agent-browser`) in any form.
- Avoid subagents, multi-model reviews, web search, image generation, and repeated/exploratory scripts.
- Grep before Read; read only needed ranges; never re-read unchanged files; batch independent calls.
- Targeted tests while working; full gate once at the end (see `tujar-dashboard-gate` skill).
- Short replies in the user's language. No extras beyond the request.
